### GET ALL - obtener todos los horarios
GET http://localhost:3000/api/schedules

### GET ONE - obtener un horario por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/schedules/1

### GET ONE - obtener un horario por email y sala
GET http://localhost:3000/api/schedules/email/profesional@mail.com/room/3

### POST - crear un nuevo horario
# @name createSchedule
POST http://localhost:3000/api/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "day": "miercoles",
  "initialHour": "21:00",
  "finalHour": "23:00",
  "person": "profesional@mail.com",
  "room": 3,
  "active": true,
  "allowedType": "normal",
  "durations": []
}

### PUT - actualizar un horario existente
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalHour": "11:00"
}

### PATCH - actualizar parcialmente un horario existente
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalHour": "11:00",
  "active": false
}

### PATCH - alternar el estado de un horario
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/schedules/toggle
Content-Type: application/json

{
}